ent  is the more it's going to offend your  values one way or the other one of the  bedrock principles of kind of the modern  enlightenment is freedom of conscience  that's what created of all things  banking secrecy and prosperity in play  like Geneva in Switzerland and it helped  us very much here in the United States  of America  I see no nothing incompatible between  being strongly religious and being  libertarian and and that's kind of the  whole point of the exercise its  tolerance we'll be back with more ask a  libertarian 2012 in just a few minutes
 

